  (text "4. Touch keys (AT42QT1011), one per outlet" (at 15.24 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 1b4018c7-ef9a-46f6-8486-d9fc384e0786))
  (text "Cs 10 nF and Rs 4.7k are starting values; tune on the EVT faceplate. OUT is active high: board_evt_c6 sets touch polarity.\nSYNC/MODE strapped low by a 0R (fit the other 0R to strap high if the datasheet mode table calls for it)." (at 15.24 29.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1d42afcd-d9b5-46e9-990a-c3d807a5a9a9))
  (text "5. NFC tag (NT3H2111)" (at 15.24 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 2d678d30-629c-4647-af90-354cf89bcfc2))
  (text "Field-powered: a phone can read the setup record with the socket unpowered. Antenna tuned to 13.56 MHz with C115 at EVT." (at 15.24 85.09 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid a8dac89a-8d41-47d2-88b5-35d90255bfb9))
  (text "6. Light lines (4 x SK6812MINI-E, two per outlet)" (at 15.24 127.0 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 3d71b7f3-8f5f-4482-bc18-05aa844562b2))
  (text "LED power is switched off in standby (Q101); the buffer runs from the switched rail so nothing back-feeds the LEDs.\n74AHCT inputs tolerate 3.3 V with VCC off. Data: IO8 -> buffer -> 33R -> D101 -> D102 -> D103 -> D104." (at 15.24 130.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 02c6502d-1bca-41dc-9fbf-30b8f76073ae))
